	(text "Kelvin source (pin 3) of each device to its own driver COM star (gate-drive sheet). Each tab on its own\nAlN ceramic (aluminium nitride) pad to the EARTHED heatsink (basic HV-PE, B2). LAYOUT (IC-22): milled slot between drain pin 1 and\npins 2-4; equal drain / source busbar paths for the two devices of a switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 153.54 0)
