	)
	(text "Lead A from SW_A1 passes the STK-HO/A 75 U-primary (pins 6-9 in, 10-13 out: + = SW_A -> SW_B) to stud\nL_A1; lead B on stud SW_B1. IL1 = 2.5 V + 10.667 mV/A (Vref 2.48-2.52 V), 0.5-4.5 V over +/-187.5 A;\n100R + 1 nF at the source. Primary at the switch node: functional barrier (4 kV rms, 8 kV impulse)."
